<section class="workflow-panel"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Call details and submitted ratings are available to authorized users for investigating call quality. Recordings require a permitted role. Use these features only for your work.</p>
<p>Do not include passwords, API tokens, or unrelated personal information in problem descriptions or IT notes. Contact your administrator for your organization's data retention and access policies.</p></section>
